      "labelA": "Shunt Network"
     },
     "items": []
    }
   },
   {
    "kind": "explain",
    "narration": "First calculate the multiplying factor m, defined as the total target current divided by meter deflection current.",
    "imageQuery": "",
    "visual": {
     "kind": "formula",
     "formula": "m = I / Im",
     "caption": ""
    }
   },
   {
    "kind": "explain",
    "narration": "Dividing 100 milliamperes by 1 milliampere gives an operating multiplying factor m equal to 100.",
    "imageQuery": "",
    "visual": {
     "kind": "bars",
     "caption": "Current comparison, mA",
     "items": [
      {
       "label": "Total Current (I)",
       "value": 100
      },
      {
       "label": "Meter Current (Im)",
       "value": 1
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "kind": "explain",
    "narration": "The standard shunt equation relates meter resistance Rm and shunt resistance Rsh by Rm divided by m minus 1.",
    "imageQuery": "",
    "visual": {
     "kind": "formula",
     "formula": "Rsh = Rm / (m - 1)",
     "caption": ""
    }
   },
   {
    "kind": "explain",
    "narration": "Subtracting one from the multiplying power of 100 yields an effective divisor of 99.",
    "imageQuery": "",
    "visual": {
     "kind": "formula",
     "formula": "m - 1 = 100 - 1 = 99",
     "caption": ""
    }
   },
   {
    "kind": "explain",
    "narration": "Now divide the meter resistance of 99 ohms by this divisor of 99.",
    "imageQuery": "",
    "visual": {
     "kind": "formula",
     "formula": "Rsh = 99 / 99 = 1 Ω",
     "caption": ""
    }
   },
   {
    "kind": "explain",
    "narration": "The calculation leaves us with a necessary shunt resistance of exactly 1 ohm.",
    "imageQuery": "",
    "visual": {
     "kind": "icon",
     "caption": "Shunt Resistance",
     "items": [
      {
       "label": "1 Ohm",
       "symbol": "🎯"
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "kind": "explain",
    "narration": "A common exam mistake is dividing by m instead of m minus one, giving 0.99 ohms.",
    "imageQuery": "",
    "visual": {
     "kind": "compare",
     "caption": "Formula Comparison",
     "items": [
      {
       "label": "Rm / (m-1) = 1 Ω",
       "symbol": "✅"
      },
      {
       "label": "Rm / m = 0.99 Ω",
       "symbol": "❌"
      }
     ]
    }
   },
